   233                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   234                              <1> ; setup_dark -- BD69, right after the mode set of AMI's page code (BD61).
   235                              <1> ; AMI's page code draws its whole page before C009 (bu_setup); on the
   236                              <1> ; board it showed for a moment. The display is switched off here and on
   237                              <1> ; again in bu_setup once the Summary page is drawn. Replaces CLI / CLD /
   238                              <1> ; MOV AX,268Ah (AX is AMI's next CMOS write); other registers kept.
   239                              <1> ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   240                              <1> setup_dark:
   241 0000136E 30C0                <1>     xor  al, al
   242 00001370 E80600              <1>     call v_screen
